OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy, wet and breezy with
OL,7,Fheavy rain in places. The rain will
OL,8,Fslowly ease from the north overnight,
OL,9,Flingering in the south by dawn.
OL,10,FStaying quite warm and humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FEarly rain soon clearing from
OL,13,Fsouthern areas to leave a mostly dry,
OL,14,Fbright and breezy day with sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Isolated showers are possible
OL,16,Fin the north though. Feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
