OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday looks mainly dry with some
OL,7,Fsunshine and fairly gentle winds.
OL,8,FTurning wet and windy from the
OL,9,Fnorthwest on Sunday, ahead of brighter
OL,10,Fskies again on Monday.
